{
  "element": "cds-password-input",
  "defaults": {
    "appearance": "neutral",
    "label": "Label",
    "supporting": "Supporting Message",
    "error": "Error Message",
    "show-label": "true",
    "show-required": "true",
    "show-lead-icon": "true",
    "show-trailing-item": "true",
    "show-supporting-content": "true",
    "show-character-counter": "true",
    "lead-icon": "placeholder-line"
  },
  "jsx": {
    "tag": "PasswordInput",
    "props": [
      {
        "prop": "label",
        "attr": "label",
        "if": {
          "show-label": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "placeholder",
        "attr": "placeholder"
      },
      {
        "prop": "defaultValue",
        "attr": "value"
      },
      {
        "prop": "required",
        "attr": "show-required",
        "bool": true
      },
      {
        "prop": "error",
        "attr": "appearance",
        "eq": "warning"
      },
      {
        "prop": "supportingMessage",
        "attr": "error",
        "if": {
          "appearance": "warning",
          "show-supporting-content": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "supportingMessage",
        "attr": "supporting",
        "if": {
          "appearance": "!warning",
          "show-supporting-content": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "characterCount",
        "attr": "maxlength",
        "num": true,
        "if": {
          "show-character-counter": "true"
        }
      },
      {
        "prop": "disabled",
        "attr": "disabled",
        "bool": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "figma": [
    [
      "Appearance",
      "appearance",
      "error",
      "Warning vira `error` (boolean). A mensagem vai em `supportingMessage`."
    ],
    [
      "State",
      "disabled",
      "disabled",
      "Só Disabled vira prop."
    ],
    [
      "Show Label",
      "show-label",
      "label",
      "Desligado: omita `label`."
    ],
    [
      "Show Required",
      "show-required",
      "required",
      "O texto \"(Obrigatório)\" vem do componente; não há prop para trocar."
    ],
    [
      "Show Supporting Content",
      "show-supporting-content",
      "supportingMessage",
      "Desligado: omita `supportingMessage`."
    ],
    [
      "Supporting Message / Error Message",
      "supporting · error",
      "supportingMessage",
      "Uma prop só: o texto muda conforme `error`."
    ],
    [
      "Show Character Counter",
      "show-character-counter",
      "characterCount",
      "No React é o limite (número), não um boolean."
    ],
    [
      "Show Trailing Item",
      "show-trailing-item",
      "—",
      "Na main é o botão de mostrar/ocultar a senha (interno no React). Na branch do hotfix CDS-2070 vira o ícone de aviso, que no React aparece sozinho com `error` (C219)."
    ],
    [
      "—",
      "placeholder",
      "placeholder",
      "Não é prop do Figma: o placeholder vem do conteúdo do campo."
    ],
    [
      "Show Lead Icon",
      "show-lead-icon",
      "—",
      "O PasswordInput do React não tem ícone à esquerda."
    ],
    [
      "Show Content",
      "show-content",
      "—",
      "O botão de mostrar/ocultar a senha é interno no React."
    ],
    [
      "—",
      "autocomplete",
      "autoComplete",
      "Atributo HTML; o playground usa `current-password`."
    ]
  ]
}
